<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17197" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exsĕcūtor</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exec-</span></b> ),
		ōris, m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an accomplisher</i>, <i>performer</i>, <i>executor</i> (postAug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acerrimus malorum propositorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sententiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 7, p. 197</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Dig. 49, 1, 4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic., in jurid. lang.,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A prosecutor</i>, <i>revenger</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">offensarum inimicitiarumque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Vesp. 14</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A collector</i>, <i><span class="en">Cod. Just.
				8, 17, 7</span></i>.</div>
